WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.347
Cow looked for blueberries.

2
00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:17.084
Pig, Cat, and Bat looked too.

3
00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:22.732
"I see some!" said Bat.

4
00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:27.186
"We must pick them," said Cow.

5
00:00:27.187 --> 00:00:48.984
The friends picked blueberries.

6
00:00:48.985 --> 00:01:01.823
They put them on the path.

7
00:01:01.824 --> 00:01:09.910
Then they told Dog about the plan.

8
00:01:09.911 --> 00:01:12.842
Dog was at Red Bird's tree.

9
00:01:12.843 --> 00:01:16.419
He watched for the bear.

10
00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:21.161
At last Dog saw something.

11
00:01:21.162 --> 00:01:23.739
It was big!

12
00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:34.052
It was black!

13
00:01:34.053 --> 00:01:41.616
The bear looked for Red Bird's food.

14
00:01:41.617 --> 00:01:43.667
But Dog barked.

15
00:01:43.668 --> 00:01:50.300
"Woof! Woof!" said Dog.

16
00:01:50.301 --> 00:01:52.575
Dog barked again.

17
00:01:52.576 --> 00:01:55.330
Then he ran to the path.

18
00:01:55.331 --> 00:01:59.019
The bear watched Dog.

19
00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:21.516
It ran to the path too.

20
00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:34.296
And it ate the blueberries!

21
00:02:34.297 --> 00:02:44.746
Now Dog barked a happy bark.

22
00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:50.087
Everyone was safe!

